    "adapterScope": "Fresh Game for each completed revealed pair carries the previous Board including particles, automaton and marks. Original Game never clears pending_moves; old slot/locking transport is not exercised. Original constructor leaves goals empty, so adapter supplies y=0 and y=10 corner goals matching the qualified two-player game. Every comparison here is completed, unmarked, nonterminal before the last round; no conflict recovery or post-terminal reset is inferred.",
